        "created_at": "2019-01-31T16:48:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When using Lay Paths They Cannot Help But Walk, can you target different pairs of lands with each elemental threshold? Also, assuming you can move backwards with presence placement, what is the point of connecting +1 range, water, air, earth, to +1 energy/turn or +1 card plays/turn. Those would never be good paths to take.</p>",
