        "cooked": "<p>(Reminder for future users: This is about the PnP version, not whatever is eventually published. I'm looking at what robb8888 posted in these forums.)</p>\n<p><strong>Q</strong>:&nbsp;<em>When using Lay Paths They Cannot Help But Walk, can you target different pairs of lands with each elemental threshold?</em></p>\n<p><strong>A:&nbsp;</strong>Yes, since it targets yourself and says \"from one of your lands to another\".</p>\n<p><strong>Q: </strong><em>Assuming you can move backwards with presence placement, what is the point of connecting +1 range, water, air, earth, to +1 energy/turn or +1 card plays/turn.</em></p>\n<p><strong>A:<em>&nbsp;</em></strong>You're correct, in that version those links are superfluous.</p>",
